(LEGAL-022 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Water \(Prevention and Control of Pollution\) Act, 1974 \(Act 6 of 1974\)  Sec) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: District Environmental Engineer \(TNPCB\) & Executive Engineer \(WRD\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Section 24\(1\)\(a\)-\(b\) \(Prohibition on Polluting Matter & Impeding Flow\)) Tj T*
(Section 24\(1\)\(a\) prohibits any person from knowingly causing or permitting any) Tj T*
(poisonous, noxious, or polluting matter \(including untreated sewage, industrial) Tj T*
(effluent, or septage tankers\) to enter any stream, well, or irrigation tank.) Tj T*
(Section 24\(1\)\(b\) prohibits depositing solid waste or debris that impedes the) Tj T*
(proper flow of water in a tank or channel.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Section 43 \(Penalty for Contravention of Section 24\)) Tj T*
(Violation of Section 24 is punishable under Section 43 with imprisonment for a) Tj T*
(term not less than one year and six months extendable up to six years and fine.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
